From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Anthony Fu (via agent)" <reg-github-bot@antfu.me>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 09:38:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(app): drop the New workspace row under an empty project

An expanded project with no workspaces showed a "New workspace" row in its
list. The project header's + button opens the same screen, and the global
New workspace row stays, so the extra row only added noise. The e2e specs
now reach creation through the header button.

Fork-Change: F-2
